<title>USA: AMBAC has capacity for Pacificorp mortgage bonds.</title>
<headline>AMBAC has capacity for Pacificorp mortgage bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ambac Assurance Corporation said it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for Pacificorp first mortgage bonds.</p>
<p>Capacity is available on a first come, first served basis. For additional information, call Mark Spinelli or Nancy Davila at (212) 480-3600.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
